{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "shahar.meet",
  "kind": "character",
  "title": "屋上に、鱗が一枚",
  "summary": "屋上庭園で日光浴していた銀白の鱗と、三県の天気を変える身じろぎ",
  "ownership": {
    "arcId": "character.shahar",
    "characterId": "shahar",
    "stage": "meet"
  },
  "trigger": {
    "actions": [
      "rest",
      "search"
    ],
    "when": {
      "all": [],
      "any": [],
      "none": []
    },
    "repeat": {
      "mode": "once-per-run"
    },
    "priority": 500,
    "weight": 1
  },
  "presentation": {
    "location": "屋上庭園",
    "assets": [
      {
        "id": "shahar.meet.asset.background.001",
        "kind": "background",
        "path": "/assets/story/bg-arena-reception.png",
        "alt": "屋上庭園の背景"
      },
      {
        "id": "shahar.meet.asset.still.001",
        "kind": "still",
        "path": "/assets/story/events/shahar-meet-sky-dragon-v2.png",
        "alt": "都市より巨大な古竜シャハルが覆う空と屋上へ降る一枚の鱗"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "shahar.meet.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "昼休み。屋上庭園は、私の避難所。今日の戦利品は、売店の限定傘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今週だけの限定色で、行列に二十分並んだ。後悔はない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ベンチの隣に、見慣れない銀白の板が立てかけてあった。畳一枚ぶんはある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "日光を浴びて、きらきらしてる。誰かの忘れ物にしては、置き方が丁寧すぎた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.bkqdo1",
      "speakerName": "シャハル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "それは板ではなく、私の鱗です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.bkqdo1",
      "speakerName": "シャハル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "日光浴の途中なので、お手を触れずに——いえ。触れても、構いませんが。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "声が空から降ってくるんですけど!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "見上げて、はっとした。耳が、ぴんと立った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日の雲、雲じゃない。屋上の空を覆う、あの銀白の霞——ぜんぶ一頭ぶん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "都市より大きい何かが、雲の高さで寝そべってる。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "shahar.meet.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.bkqdo1",
      "speakerName": "シャハル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "古竜シャハル。体はこの街に入らないので、鱗を一枚だけ、下ろしています。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.bkqdo1",
      "speakerName": "シャハル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……ところで、その傘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "こ、これですか?　今週限定の、限定色で……"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.bkqdo1",
      "speakerName": "シャハル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "存じています。売店の行列を、三日前から上空より観測していました。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.bkqdo1",
      "speakerName": "シャハル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……その色は、何年もちますか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "何年って……今週で販売終了です。だから並んだんですよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "空の気配が、すっと冷めた。「今週で終わり」の一言で、興味の火が消える音がした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "三日も観測してたくせに。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.bkqdo1",
      "speakerName": "シャハル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "では、見送ります。私は長いので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.bkqdo1",
      "speakerName": "シャハル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "どうせ終わるものに本気になると、あとが長いのです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.011c",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.011c",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.bkqdo1",
      "speakerName": "シャハル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……勇者の来訪も、流行も、私の物語も。全部、先に終わりました。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "長生きの言い分は、寂しさの正装だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.012b",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.012b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私の物語も先に終わった——聞き流せない一言が、雲の上から降ってきた。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私は考える前に、限定傘を開いて、鱗の隣に差した。銀白の鱗に、限定色がよく映えた。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.014a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.014a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "終わる前に見るのと、終わってから聞くのって、ぜんぜん違いますよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.014b",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.014b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "ほら、今週限定の色です。今、見ないと。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.015a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.015a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "空が、身じろぎした。ゴ、と遠雷みたいな音がした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.015b",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.015b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "屋上の風向きが変わる。この瞬間、三県の天気予報が訂正された。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.016a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.016a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.bkqdo1",
      "speakerName": "シャハル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "…………いい色です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.016b",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.016b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.bkqdo1",
      "speakerName": "シャハル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "記録します。「本日、いい色を見た」と。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.017a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.017a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "そのとき、手のひらに、小さな雲がひとつ降りてきた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.017b",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.017b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "綿あめくらいの、ちゃんと冷たい本物の雲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.017c",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.017c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「挨拶です」と空が言う。握手の代わりだそう。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.018a",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.018a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "手のひらの雲は、ひんやりして、少しだけ心拍を上げた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.line.018b",
      "lineId": "shahar.meet.line.018b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "昼休みは、あと十分。この十分を、どう使うかだ。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "shahar.meet.choice.001",
          "label": "鱗を屋上の一席として扱う",
          "result": "私は鱗の隣に「予約席」の札を立てた。「屋上庭園・古竜様御一行(鱗一枚)」と書いた。空が笑った気がして、屋上の花が一斉に揺れた。以後、昼休みの屋上には、銀白の鱗と限定傘が並んで立っている。",
          "intent": "規格外のお客様に、ちゃんと席を用意する",
          "promise": "目先の報酬は得ない代わりに、この人が何を見送ってきたかを知る。",
          "memory": "鱗に席を用意した店員として、シャハルは私を覚えている。",
          "tone": "tender",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "shahar"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 7,
              "ownership": -2
            }
          ],
          "goto": "shahar.meet.node.effect.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "shahar.meet.choice.002",
          "label": "今日はシャハルを誘わず、用事へ戻る",
          "result": "昼休みが終わり、私は仕事へ戻った。翌朝、屋上のベンチに小さな雲がひとつ、文鎮みたいに私の忘れた傘を押さえていた。傘は飛ばされず、雲は三日間消えなかった。長い人の「またね」は、耐久性が違う。",
          "intent": "今日は昼休みの残りを大事にする",
          "promise": "所属選手にはならないが、後の出来事で再会できる。",
          "memory": "限定傘の色を見せた店員のことを、シャハルは覚えている。",
          "tone": "pragmatic",
          "effects": [],
          "goto": "shahar.meet.node.effect.001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "markEncountered",
          "fighterId": "shahar",
          "encountered": true
        },
        {
          "type": "setStoryStage",
          "fighterId": "shahar",
          "stage": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "shahar.meet.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
